          "en": "The younger historian argued that civilization could not survive without organized writing.",
          "highlight": [
            "civilization"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "這位年輕歷史學家主張，沒有有組織的書寫系統，文明便無法存續。"
          }
