          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Researchers stress that a robust correlation alone does not prove a direct causal link.",
          "highlight": [
            "correlation"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "研究者強調，單憑穩健的相關性並不能證明存在直接的因果關係。"
